WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.185 --> 00:00:04.990
In the middle of a treatment, you find the gel polish or the remover has run out?

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:09.207
VaraaAi's stock keeps track of what's in your salon, where it's kept,

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:10.590
and what you need to buy.

00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:11.630
All from your phone.

00:00:12.276 --> 00:00:13.233
Tap Stock.

00:00:13.464 --> 00:00:17.408
At the top are the number of items, what's running low, what's out of stock,

00:00:17.358 --> 00:00:18.433
and the stock value.

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:21.313
To add something, tap Add an item.

00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:26.993
Fill in the name, colour, brand, type, what it's counted in, and the minimum.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.211
When the quantity drops to that minimum,

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:31.313
the item goes on the shopping list by itself.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.169
When a delivery arrives, tap Scan in,

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:37.150
and hold the product's barcode up to the camera.

00:00:37.499 --> 00:00:39.710
For something new, take a photo instead:

00:00:40.058 --> 00:00:43.310
AI reads the name, brand and colour for you.

00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:44.990
Taking something out to use?

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:46.030
Tap Scan out.

00:00:46.237 --> 00:00:46.990
Can't scan?

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:50.270
Tap the item, then tap plus one or minus one.

00:00:50.869 --> 00:00:54.064
At the end of the month, count what's really in the cupboard,

00:00:54.014 --> 00:00:55.559
enter the number under Count,

00:00:55.677 --> 00:00:57.479
and tap Update the count.

00:00:57.881 --> 00:01:01.479
You can also note which cupboard it's kept in, and the expiry date.

00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:05.570
The To buy tab gathers everything that has reached its minimum,

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.854
with an estimated cost.

00:01:07.123 --> 00:01:10.774
Tap Copy the list, or Print the list, and off you go to buy.

00:01:11.021 --> 00:01:14.214
The History tab shows who added or took what, and when.

00:01:14.563 --> 00:01:17.324
And in Cupboards and labels, you add your cupboards,

00:01:17.274 --> 00:01:19.254
and print QR labels to stick on them.

00:01:19.574 --> 00:01:20.774
Now take the quiz below.
